              <span class="section-kicker">Featured Product Visual</span>
              <h3>Key product views that supported customer and operator workflows</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Community platform for gyms and fitness brands that combines event discovery, member interaction, and engagement workflows in one scalable product.</p>
